Z||000001||deceler8||03-07-2001||10:05 PM||||Well, given that every car Chrysler built during that period was on a K car platform, buckets from any Chrysler product oughta work in your Reliant.<P>My bro in law just sent a mint '88 Shadow ES to the salvage yard because he blew the head gasket (IDIOT)...had two beautiful buckets in it. And I'm pissed because this used to be my car.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/deceler8_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Formula||03-08-2001||09:08 AM||||any spirit, shadow, dynasty..etc.. should bucket seats that fit nicely in there.<P><BR>on a side note...we put ford probe seats in an F150 4x4 so that we could put a 150 db stereo in it. LOL<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/yellowtored3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
